{"title":"This Full-Suspension, Dropper-Equipped Scott E-Ville eBike Could Be the Perfect Commuter","link":"https://bikerumor.com/2027-scott-e-ville-full-suspension-city-commuter-ebike/","date":1792072800000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-hero-Large-e1792011072603.jpeg\" width=\"1056\" height=\"600\" alt=\"(Photos / Scott)\" /></p>\n<p>Scott’s urban e-bike push just got more interesting, courtesy of an all-new E-Ville. Fresh off the <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/scott-enters-the-urban-commuter-market-with-new-sweep-e-bikes/\" target=\"_blank\">Sweep commuter</a> line launched in July around Bosch’s new Hub Line motors, Scott has unveiled the E-Ville for 2027. The new mid-drive E-Ville is a full-suspension, low step-through e-bike that borrows more from the trail than the bike lane.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike windows 2 Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-windows-2-Large-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / Scott)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Scott says the E-Ville is the one bike for everything: the grocery run, the commute, and the “I’ll just take the long way home” detour that turns into two hours. To make that work, the E-Ville gets a 6061 alloy frame with a side-extraction downtube battery, an adjustable stem, and a Syncros dropper post. Yes, a dropper on a step-through commuter, which is totally a solid idea.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike stipes 2 Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-stipes-2-Large-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike taillight 2 Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-taillight-2-Large-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The addition of a dropper to a commuter makes sitting flat-footed at stops much easier. Tap a button at the light, drop the saddle, and plant your foot like you’ve done this before.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Bosch Power for Both Models</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike motor Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-motor-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Power comes from a Bosch Performance Line CX, which delivers up to 100Nm of torque. Battery size depends on the model: 800Wh on the E-Ville 10 SUV and 720Wh on the E-Ville 20. Both can also add a Bosch PowerMore external range extender to go further.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The ebike’s full-suspension will also be a welcome addition for some commuters, as back comfort is usually a big deal. The new E-Ville’s rear suspension is classy and clean in its tidy execution.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike rear Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-Large-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike tire Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-tire-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The rear shock is tucked inside the frame, just like on their Bold-inspired mountain bikes. So it stays out of the street grime and, ideally, out of the repair stand.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike chrage port Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-chrage-port-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Plus, it adds a clean, fancy, and high-tech aesthetic.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike pink rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-pink-rear-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 20 silverf rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-silverf-rear-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You didn’t even notice that it was a full-suspension at first, did you?</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Scott E-Ville 10 SUV</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike suv\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876-297x238.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876-120x96.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876-768x614.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-e1792013326876-1125x900.jpeg 1125w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The 10 SUV is the more capable of the two. It gets a 120mm RockShox Recon Silver RL fork, 100mm of rear travel from an SR Suntour Raidon shock inside the frame, 60mm-wide Schwalbe Advancer all-terrain tires, a Shimano Cues 11-speed drivetrain, and a Bosch Kiox 300 display.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It comes in tawny green or peach pink.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike suv pink\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-pink-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike suv front green\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-suv-front-green-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h4>Features</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>All-terrain tires</li>\n\n\n\n<li>120mm front and 100mm rear suspension travel</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bosch 800Wh battery</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bosch Kiox 300 display</li>\n\n\n\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>The Scott E-Ville 20</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"973\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 20 feature\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459-297x226.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459-120x91.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459-768x584.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-feature-e1792013280459-1184x900.jpeg 1184w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The E-Ville 20 is the urban-leaning version, with 100mm front and rear travel, an SR Suntour XCM34 air fork and the same rear shock, Schwalbe Big Apple Performance tires, a 10-speed Cues drivetrain, and a Bosch Purion 200 display. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>It comes in tungsten grey or silt green.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 10 light green\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10-light-green-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 20 cpit\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-cpit-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h4>Features</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Urban tires</li>\n\n\n\n<li>100mm front and rear suspension travel</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bosch 720Wh battery</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bosch Purion 200 display</li>\n\n\n\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Brakes, Battery, Relaxed Geometry &amp; Bits</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike side batt Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-side-batt-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Both models stop with Shimano four-piston MT4120 brakes and 180mm rotors. This seems like more than adequate for a bike that can weigh over 66lbs (30kg). Scott lists claimed weights of 68.7lbs (31.16kg) for the 10 SUV and 69lbs (31.3kg) for the 20.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10SUV-geo-Large-e1792011528598.jpeg\"><img width=\"454\" height=\"550\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10SUV-geo-Large-e1792011528598.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 10SUV geo Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10SUV-geo-Large-e1792011528598.jpeg 454w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10SUV-geo-Large-e1792011528598-248x300.jpeg 248w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-10SUV-geo-Large-e1792011528598-99x120.jpeg 99w\" /></a><figcaption>E-Ville 10 SUV</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-geo-Large-e1792011654964.jpeg\"><img width=\"440\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-geo-Large-e1792011654964.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike 20 geo Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-geo-Large-e1792011654964.jpeg 440w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-geo-Large-e1792011654964-244x300.jpeg 244w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-20-geo-Large-e1792011654964-98x120.jpeg 98w\" /></a><figcaption>E-Ville 20</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The E-Ville geometry seems a bit more relaxed than you’d expect from a commuter. A 66° head angle (66.5° on the 20 with the shorter travel fork), 76° seat angle, and a low bottom bracket around 326 to 331 mm should make it stable and easy to live with. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Frame sizes run S to XL, and all roll on 29-inch wheels.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike rear light Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-rear-light-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike front light Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-front-light-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The everyday stuff is covered, too: a Racktime SNAPIT 2.0 rear rack, integrated front and rear lights, full fenders, and an SP Connect phone mount integrated on top of the stem. It’s a bike built to do just about anything you can think of on a random Tuesday. It certainly looks like a great all-rounder commuter.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"Scott E-Ville Commuter eBike cockpit Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large-297x167.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large-120x68.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Scott-E-Ville-Commuter-eBike-cockpit-Large-1200x675.jpeg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><em><s>Scott hasn’t shared pricing or availability yet</s></em>. Given the spec, expect it to sit well above entry-level commuters. We’ll update when we hear more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>OK, we got some numbers. The slightly more off-road-ready Scott E-Ville 10 SUV retails for 5400€, while the E-Ville 20 sells for 4600€. No USD pricing suggests they aren’t coming to the States any time too soon</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hit the link for more info, as well as spec details. </p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.scott-sports.com/us/en?gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=21479464548&amp;gbraid=0AAAAACkUuTYn-krYz1DKQ7-4phrEZZLd-&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw0LzWBhBOEiwAKQd0cLwtFpjFdV--8CxNDSkBL4y5PkWCRNX-GCBTubkOEoXjVtFjVPTBoRoCjwAQAvD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\">Scott-Sports.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/2027-scott-e-ville-full-suspension-city-commuter-ebike/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"dc1195844051d811f33afae00fa6b2436db4d50c37dda2628b231b0a3d2f50bf","category":"Cycling"}